{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19135","headline":"送元简上人适越 · 刘禹锡","name":"送元简上人适越","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤云出岫本无依，胜境名山即是归。\n久向吴门游好寺，还思越水洗尘机。\n浙江涛惊狮子吼，稽岭峰疑灵鹫飞。\n更入天台石桥去，垂珠璀璨拂三衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19135.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19135","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}